{"id":"commandement","lemma":"commandement","pos":"noun","rank":2315,"glosses":["command, order","authority, power to command, to give orders; command","commander"],"ipa":"/kɔ.mɑ̃d.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/8/83/Fr-commandement.ogg/Fr-commandement.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"commandements"},"formAudio":{"commandements":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5d/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-DenisdeShawi-commandements.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous sommes sous son commandement.","en":"We are under his command.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"his, her, its"},null]},{"text":"Prenez le commandement.","en":"Take command.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Prends le commandement.","en":"Take command.","words":[{"g":"to take","l":"prendre"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Les militaires ont une chaîne de commandement très stricte.","en":"The military has a very strict chain of command.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"military","l":"militaire"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"chain"},{"g":"of / from"},null,{"g":"very"},{"g":"strict","l":"strict"}]},{"text":"Le haut commandement a décidé d'attaquer à l'aube.","en":"The high command decided to attack at dawn.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"high"},null,{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to decide","l":"décider"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to attack"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"paddle, blade"}]}]}